{
  "//": [
    "Permissions shared by every checkout of this repository, so a fresh",
    "machine or account is not prompted for the read-only and rebuild-only",
    "commands this project runs constantly. Machine-specific settings go in",
    ".claude/settings.local.json, which .gitignore keeps out of the repo.",
    "",
    "The test for entry here is that a command either changes nothing, or",
    "changes only a generated artefact that `make all` would rewrite anyway.",
    "Anything that writes to the remote, to history, or to repository",
    "settings is deliberately absent and stays a prompt: git commit, push,",
    "gh pr merge, and `gh api` with a method. Read-only `gh api` calls are",
    "not listed either, because the allow-rule cannot distinguish them from",
    "a PUT to branch protection."
  ],
  "permissions": {
    "allow": [
      "Bash(git status:*)",
      "Bash(git log:*)",
      "Bash(git diff:*)",
      "Bash(git show:*)",
      "Bash(git branch:*)",
      "Bash(git remote:*)",
      "Bash(git fetch:*)",
      "Bash(git pull:*)",
      "Bash(git stash list:*)",
      "Bash(git worktree list:*)",
      "Bash(git rev-list:*)",
      "Bash(git rev-parse:*)",
      "Bash(git cat-file:*)",
      "Bash(git merge-base:*)",
      "Bash(git check-mailmap:*)",
      "Bash(git shortlog:*)",

      "Bash(make build:*)",
      "Bash(make verify:*)",
      "Bash(make test:*)",
      "Bash(make audit:*)",
      "Bash(make export:*)",
      "Bash(make check:*)",
      "Bash(make all:*)",
      "Bash(make ci:*)",
      "Bash(make help:*)",

      "Bash(python3 build.py:*)",
      "Bash(python3 verify.py:*)",
      "Bash(python3 audit.py:*)",
      "Bash(python3 export_json.py:*)",
      "Bash(python3 -m unittest:*)",
      "Bash(python3 -m ruff check:*)",
      "Bash(python3 tools/readme_figures.py:*)",
      "Bash(python3 ./f1:*)",
      "Bash(actionlint:*)",

      "Bash(npm test:*)",
      "Bash(npm ci:*)",
      "Bash(npm run:*)",

      "Bash(gh auth status:*)",
      "Bash(gh repo view:*)",
      "Bash(gh pr list:*)",
      "Bash(gh pr view:*)",
      "Bash(gh pr diff:*)",
      "Bash(gh pr checks:*)",
      "Bash(gh run list:*)",
      "Bash(gh run view:*)",
      "Bash(gh issue list:*)",
      "Bash(gh issue view:*)",

      "Bash(ls:*)",
      "Bash(cat:*)",
      "Bash(head:*)",
      "Bash(tail:*)",
      "Bash(grep:*)",
      "Bash(rg:*)",
      "Bash(find:*)",
      "Bash(wc:*)",
      "Bash(file:*)",
      "Bash(du:*)",
      "Bash(sed -n:*)",
      "Bash(which:*)"
    ]
  }
}
